<%# The teardrop "flame" glyph for ta flamme (streak) — distinct from the
    spark diamond so the two renamed-to-similar-sounding concepts (étincelles
    vs. flamme) stay visually distinguishable at a glance. %>
<span class="inline-block shrink-0 <%= size %> <%= color %>"
      style="border-radius: 60% 0 55% 55%; transform: rotate(45deg)"
      aria-hidden="true"></span>
